[[File:King Black Dragon chathead.png|left]]
The '''King Black Dragon''', commonly referred to as '''KBD''', is a three-headed dragon located in [[King Black Dragon Lair|his lair]], accessible only through the deep [[Wilderness]]. With a [[combat level]] of 276, he is one of the strongest [[Dragon (race)|dragons]] in ''[[Old School RuneScape]]''.

His lair is a [[multicombat area]]. Though designated as a [[Wilderness]] boss, the lair itself is not in the Wilderness, so players cannot attack each other and there are no teleport restrictions. Completion of the [[Wilderness Diary]] also '''does not''' note his bone drops.

Players can pay {{NoCoins|50,000|c}} to fight the King Black Dragon in an [[instanced]] area inaccessible by other players (right-click ''Private'' option on lever). Players do not need to carry coins on them, as the fee may be deducted from the bank. Items dropped by the boss in this instance will disappear after 30 minutes, though items dropped by the player will disappear after the typical 3 minutes.

The King Black Dragon counts towards a [[black dragon]] [[Slayer task]], '''except''' when assigned by [[Krystilia]].

