===Death mechanics===
{{Safe death|IRS=no|HCIM=no|HCGIM=no}}
[[Death|Dying]] results in different outcomes dependent on if the player was in an instance. Within an instance, all unprotected items will be moved to a grave outside the instance, in the Wilderness itself. Any items left on the ground will be lost.

In the main lair, the gravestone will be located where the player died.

Dying at the King Black Dragon causes the contents of an [[Item Retrieval Service]] to be lost.

Dying at the King Black Dragon is a [[Death#Unsafe and safe deaths|dangerous death]], and results in {{Ironman|icon|mode=HCIM}} [[Ironman_Mode#Hardcore_Ironman|Hardcore Ironman]] players losing their Hardcore status and {{Ironman|icon|mode=HCGIM}} [[Group_Ironman_Mode#Hardcore_Group_Ironman|Hardcore Group Ironman]] players losing a life.

